<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1899</h1><p class="ref-lede">1899 in world history: 29 events, 20 births, 11 deaths, 2 works, 5 states founded and 4 that came to an end. 851 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
